SUMMARY:Special Invitation: Mosaic Realty's Art Walk & Benefit
DESCRIPTION:AVL International Connections\nI wanted to personally invite y
 ou all to the Mosaic Realty Art Walk happening on **May 7 from 5p-8p**. Fo
 r more information go to [mosaicartwalk.com](mosaicartwalk.com) to see the
  non-profits and downtown galleries we will be partnering with that night!
  I am going to be at the **YMI Cultural Center Gallery** @ 39 S. Market St
 reet for the event\, one of the oldest\, most unique and beautiful Black c
 ultural centers in the United States. The YMI is a local landmark within t
 he City of Asheville\, North Carolina and is on the National Register of H
 istoric Places. There will be **light hors d’oeuvres and drinks** and so
 me great raffle prizes at the different galleries\, with the proceeds from
  the night going to 11 area non-profits.\n\nLook forward to seeing you!\n-
 Ward
